1) Install Dirac, Openfermion, Psi4, Openfermion-Psi4, and the requirements for openfermion
2) I changed the dirac_mointegral_export.F90 into dirac_openfermion_mointegrals_export.F90, in order to sort the integrals as in psi4. For H2 and LiH, it works.
3) Add the PATH of the dirac/build/ directory to your bash_profile to use
- pam, the run_script of dirac
- dirac_openfermion_mointegrals_export, which creates the FCIDUMP from the one_body_integrals (MRCONEE) and the two_body_integrals (MDCINT)

$> cd src/openfermion_interface 
$> pip install -e .

4) an example if furnished in src/openfermion_interface/work_dir/h2_dirac.py and src/openfermion_interface/workdir/LiH_dirac.py
